### Day 10: API Quality, Versioning, Docs and Reports
### Run the app first: mvn spring-boot:run


### Public health check
GET http://localhost:8082/api/health


### Public API information
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/info


### Public API documentation endpoint
GET http://localhost:8082/api/docs


### Login as seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy the token from the login response and paste it below
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJyb2xlIjoiQURNSU4iLCJuYW1lIjoiSmFzb24iLCJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDg4MDUzOSwiZXhwIjoxNzg0OTY2OTM5fQ.t9WL8DuRB3F4F9YiI_EdPxA0J4nvb3j-lNWp4y1zwN4


### Versioned endpoint: get all tickets
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Versioned endpoint: paged tickets
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### API quality: invalid page should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=-1&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### API quality: invalid size should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=100&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### API quality: invalid sort field should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=password&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Report: tickets grouped by status
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report: tickets grouped by priority
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report: tickets grouped by category (not implemented yet)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Report: tickets grouped by location (not implemented yet)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-location
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}